WEBVTT

00:14:29.636 --> 00:14:31.836
and that we need
to rewrite them for everybody.

00:14:31.876 --> 00:14:35.636
WPR: We have another voice,
another woman, Sophia,

00:14:35.676 --> 00:14:37.916
who is here to share her story as well.

00:14:37.956 --> 00:14:40.396
And I think it'll be great
to hear from her.

00:14:40.436 --> 00:14:41.716
DP: Hi, Sophia.

00:14:41.756 --> 00:14:44.436
I actually name you in the book.

00:14:44.476 --> 00:14:45.956
So you are named in the book,

00:14:45.996 --> 00:14:48.356
I should just say that in the beginning.

00:14:48.396 --> 00:14:50.956
I'd love if you would share
a little bit of, you know,

00:14:50.956 --> 00:14:54.796
as a woman of color
navigating work spaces,

00:14:54.796 --> 00:14:56.796
an example of when you
didn't feel powerful

00:14:56.836 --> 00:15:00.236
or how you kind of navigate power,
we can unpack that a little bit.